#   The ADIF is application/libraries/AdifHelper.php getAdifHeader() (lines 272-279) and one
#   getAdifLine() per QSO (lines 5-270): upper-case tags, one "<FIELD:LEN>value\r\n" per
#   non-empty field (getAdifFieldLine, lines 281-287; LEN is mb_strlen, characters), in the
#   order of its $normalFields list, then FREQ, QSO_DATE, TIME_ON, QSO_DATE_OFF, TIME_OFF and
#   the MY_ station fields, ending "<EOR>\r\n\r\n".
